Package: Refinitiv
Type: Package
Title: Connect to LSEG Workspace, Refinitiv Eikon, and DataStream from R
Version: 0.2.4
Authors@R: person(given = "Laurens",
                  family = "van der Burg",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "laurens@ggbo.eu")
Description: Zero-config R interface to LSEG Workspace (formerly Refinitiv Eikon)
    and DataStream. Auto-detects the running terminal, connects via direct JSON
    API calls, and provides opt-in session-scoped request caching. Includes
    historical and snapshot data retrieval, real-time WebSocket streaming, ESG,
    consensus estimates, ownership data, symbol conversion, custom instruments,
    and news. DataStream access is provided via the 'DatastreamDSWS2R' package.
    This package is in no way affiliated with LSEG, Refinitiv, Eikon or
    Datastream. Use at own risk.
License: LGPL (>= 2.0, < 3) | Mozilla Public License
